<!-- ════════════════ 39 · THE HONEST NUMBERS ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Honest numbers" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #d97706;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">39</span>The honest numbers</p>
          <h2 class="h2">AI speeds things up, but <span class="accent">not automatically</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 40px; align-content: start;">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">GitHub Copilot</span>
          <h3>55% faster</h3>
          <p>On a scoped task, Copilot users finished the work in 1h11 versus 2h41.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">METR study</span>
          <h3>19% slower</h3>
          <p>Experienced devs on their own codebase were actually slower with AI, while believing they were faster.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Made-up packages</span>
          <h3>1 in 5</h3>
          <p>About 20 percent of suggested dependencies don't exist. Attackers abuse those names.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        DORA 2025: AI is an <strong>amplifier</strong>. Strong teams get better, weak teams see their problems magnified.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "39" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "41" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
